{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/mnvuhq","slide":1,"text":"Research sources:\n\nSmart India Hackathon problem statement 26032: https://sih.gov.in/sih2026PS\n\ne-NAM official overview and farmer features: https://www.enam.gov.in/ and https://www.enam.gov.in/web/stakeholders-Involved/farmers\n\nAgriStack Farmer Registry, UFSI, sandbox and consent architecture: https://agristack.gov.in/\n\nPFMS DBT FAQ and external-system integration: https://pfms.nic.in/SitePages/doc/PFMS_DBT_FAQ.pdf\n\nDigital Personal Data Protection Act 2023: https://www.meity.gov.in/writereaddata/files/Digital%20Personal%20Data%20Protection%20Act%202023.pdf\n\nCurrent prototype evidence: docs/pitch_deck/FEATURE_VALIDATION_CURRENT_CODEBASE.md and docs/migration/LOAD-TEST-REPORT.md\n\nThe ecosystem diagram avoids unsupported competitor exclusions. AnnSetu is positioned as a queue and coordination layer that complements existing trading, identity, payment and state procurement systems."}